{"caption":"Six-panel chart comparing VERA scores across backbone sizes and against other models on four benchmarks.","description":"A six-panel chart arranged in two columns and three rows. Green marks VERA; gray marks comparison models. Panels (a) and (b) are line charts with backbone size (4B, 9B, 27B) on the x-axis and overall score on the y-axis. In (a), AutoCoWorkBench, VERA rises from 12.1 to 31 to 71.6, while the dashed gray Base LLM rises from 4.1 to 16.8 to 55; VERA is higher at each size. In (b), AutoMedBench, VERA rises from 38.6 to 69.1 to 80.7, while Base LLM rises from 18.4 to 52 to 63.9; VERA is higher at each size. Each line chart also has a dotted “Best frontier reference” line and a small AI symbol. The legend identifies the green solid line as VERA and the gray dashed line as Base LLM. The icon beside panel (a) depicts two people at computers and is labeled “CoWork”; the icon beside panel (b) depicts a medical chart and a small medical device and is labeled “Med.” There are no arrows or directional connectors.

Panels (c) and (d) are horizontal overall-score bar charts with score ticks at 0, 25, 50, and 75. In (c), AutoCoWorkBench, the bars rank from highest to lowest: VERA-CoWork-27B 71.6 (green), GPT-5.6-Sol 70.3, Claude-Opus-4.8 66.6, Qwen3.8-27B 55, GLM-5.2 52.7, GPT-5.6-Terra 52.5, and DeepSeek-V4-Pro 39.2. In (d), AutoMedBench, they rank: VERA-Med-27B 80.7 (green), Claude-Opus-4.8 80.5, GPT-5.6-Sol 75.1, DeepSeek-V4-Pro 72.4, GPT-5.6-Terra 68.3, Qwen3.8-27B 63.9, and GLM-5.2 56.3. VERA is narrowly ahead of the next model in panel (d).

Panel (e), Automation Bench, is a horizontal pass-rate bar chart with ticks at 0, 15, 30, and 45. Its bars rank: GPT-5.6-Sol 45.8, VERA-CoWork-27B 43.8 (green), Claude-Opus-4.8 41, GPT-5.6-Terra 37.2, DeepSeek-V4-Pro 31.8, GLM-5.2 26.2, and Qwen3.8-27B 24.6. Panel (f), AgentClinic, is a horizontal accuracy bar chart with ticks at 0, 30, 60, and 90. Its bars rank: Claude-Opus-4.8 84.1, GPT-5.6-Sol 80.4, VERA-Med-27B 76.4 (green), GLM-5.2 74.8, GPT-5.6-Terra 72.1, DeepSeek-V4-Pro 58.8, and Qwen3.8-27B 43.9. Bar-end values are printed on the chart; all plotted values listed here are printed values.","figure_type":"chart","chart_values":[{"series":"VERA (a)","category":"4B","x":"4B","value":12.1,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"VERA (a)","category":"9B","x":"9B","value":31,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"VERA (a)","category":"27B","x":"27B","value":71.6,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"Base LLM (a)","category":"4B","x":"4B","value":4.1,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"Base LLM (a)","category":"9B","x":"9B","value":16.8,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"Base LLM (a)","category":"27B","x":"27B","value":55,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"VERA (b)","category":"4B","x":"4B","value":38.6,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"VERA (b)","category":"9B","x":"9B","value":69.1,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"VERA (b)","category":"27B","x":"27B","value":80.7,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"Base LLM (b)","category":"4B","x":"4B","value":18.4,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"Base LLM (b)","category":"9B","x":"9B","value":52,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"Base LLM (b)","category":"27B","x":"27B","value":63.9,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"AutoCoWorkBench (c)","category":"VERA-CoWork-27B","x":71.6,"value":71.6,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"AutoCoWorkBench (c)","category":"GPT-5.6-Sol","x":70.3,"value":70.3,"value_status":"printed"},{"series":"AutoCoWorkBench (c)","category":"Claude-Opus-4.8","x":66.6,"value":66.6,"value_status":"